  "category": "Dry",
  "description": "Progresso Light Creamy Chicken Noodle Soup has at least 33% fewer calories and 50% less fat per serving than regular ready-to-serve soups*. This Progresso Soup delivers the familiar, delicious flavors of chicken noodle soup, made with chicken broth, carrots, celery, white meat chicken, egg noodle, and more, with 230 calories per can (see nutrition information for sodium content). Our microwavable soup is ready to eat in minutes by following the easy warming directions on the can. Made without artificial flavors or colors from artificial sources, each can contains a half cup of vegetables. About two servings per can. At Progresso, we're passionate about making great products. We've been creating soups ranging from Chicken Noodle to Tomato Basil and beyond for more than 100 years. And today, Progresso still uses quality ingredients for enticing flavor found in our line of canned soup products. Contains shelf-stable Progresso Light, Creamy Chicken Noodle Canned Soup, 18.5 oz. *Progresso Light: 110 calories, 3g fat per serving. Average of creamy chicken and pasta ready-to-serve soups: 200 calories, 10g fat. CREAMY CHICKEN NOODLE: Delivers the familiar, delicious flavors of chicken noodle soup, made with chicken broth, carrots, celery, white meat chicken, and egg noodle, with 230 calories per can (see nutrition information for sodium content) LIGHT PROGRESSO SOUP: At least 33% fewer calories and 50% less fat per serving than regular ready-to-serve soups*; *Progresso Light: 110 calories, 3g fat per serving - Average of creamy chicken and pasta ready-to-serve soups: 200 calories, 10g fat QUALITY INGREDIENTS: No artificial flavors or colors from artificial sources QUICK AND EASY: Progresso soup is ready to serve; Unlike instant ramen, there's no need to add water - just warm it on a stovetop or in a microwave in minutes (if hot, handle with care) CONTAINS: Shelf-stable Progresso Light, Creamy Chicken Noodle Canned Soup, 18.5 oz",
